      "text": "Role in SSc:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " Raynaud: long-acting oral nifedipine (eg, 30 to 120 mg a day) may help but may worsen gastric reflux."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
